  "body": "The new room is published in the directory, but so is the old one. The old one should be pulled from the directory.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, if the room was published on a homeserver which did *not* perform the upgrade, the old room is left on the directory and the new one is *not* published when the user joins.\r\n\r\nExpected behaviour:\r\n* Upgrading a room which is published to your homeserver's directory publishes the new room (works)\r\n* Joining an upgraded room where the old room was published should publish the new room (doesn't work).\r\n* In both cases, the old room is removed from the directory on the servers (doesn't work x2)",
